{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"broadcast-senders-receiver-count-001","description":"A broadcast with two senders (t.a and the clone t.b, Rust Sender::clone, broadcast.rs:577) and two subscribers. Each send observes the receivers it reached (:494): 2, then 1 after t.r2 drops its receiver. t.a's drop leaves the channel open; t.b's end drops the last sender, and t.r1, having read 1 and 2, then sees it closed (ASX_E_DISCONNECTED). A send with no receiver left is refused: t.c's channel has none by then (bd-9kll.5.6).","unit":"broadcast","rules":["inv.determinism.replayable"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":1000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[{"name":"bc","type":"broadcast","capacity":4,"sender":"t.a","senders":["t.b"],"subscribers":["t.r1","t.r2"]},{"name":"bc2","type":"broadcast","capacity":2,"sender":"t.c","subscribers":["t.r3"]}],"sync":[],"tasks":[{"name":"t.a","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"broadcast_send","channel":"bc","value":1},{"op":"close_sender","channel":"bc"},{"op":"trace","message":"a dropped its sender"}]},{"name":"t.b","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"broadcast_send","channel":"bc","value":2},{"op":"trace","message":"b sent"}]},{"name":"t.r1","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"broadcast_recv","channel":"bc"},{"op":"broadcast_recv","channel":"bc"},{"op":"broadcast_recv","channel":"bc"},{"op":"trace","message":"r1 saw the close"}]},{"name":"t.r2","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"broadcast_recv","channel":"bc"},{"op":"close_receiver","channel":"bc"}]},{"name":"t.r3","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"close_receiver","channel":"bc2"}]},{"name":"t.c","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":50},{"op":"broadcast_send","channel":"bc2","value":9}]}],"script":[],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
